  "notes": "55x55 cm and the 10 kg limit are IKEA's own product text; 45 cm is the published LACK side-table height. Part number 115980 is NOT set here: it is extractable from the current US manual (AA-2606170-1) but this 2006 NL page is pure vector art with no text, so it needs confirming against the drawing. Hotspot boxes are the fine pass of suggest_boxes.py; the mapping of the two lower panels to 'legs on' and 'turn it over' is inferred from reading order and wants a human eye. The face-down/turn-over choreography needs parented keyframes, which the schema supports but the viewer does not yet play."
